codex
The prior remediation closes the reported missing-key, replay-identity, lock-symlink, and retiring-fence cases. Two separate implementation paths remain suspect: a successful commit can retire its only recovery journal before the literature files/directories are made durable, and the producer can sign a cursor-conflict state that its own loader later rejects after cursor advancement. I’m checking those against all named tests before fixing the verdict.
